	(text "Only a dozen pins from the 128 are in use.\nIt might be a good idea not to solder the full 2x32 pin sockets\nbut to use shorter sockets or ones with just one row\n(or a combination) to cover the pins in use.\nThe reason is that otherwise it is quite difficult to disconnect\nthe microcontroller evalboard from this PCB without breakinng it.\nWhat also works well is to plug the socket into the dev-kit and\nsolder it then."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 37.846 131.064 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "4ee86c85-021e-42cc-8768-4d1fafb777a1")
	)
	(text "DMX output to LED party panel:\nPC12 = UART5_TX\nPC11 = Enable\n\nList of PWM outputs:\nPB4  = TIM3_CH1	red\nPC8  = TIM3_CH3	green\nPE5  = TIM9_CH1	blue\nPE6  = TIM9_CH2	white\nPB7  = TIM4_CH2	available for special function\n\nUSART for other purposes:\nPG14 = USART6_TX (with LED RED indicator LD4)\nPG9  = USART6_RX\n\nUSART for OpenLog (log data on SD card):\nPE6 (might be on another pin) = GRN = reset\nPA9  = USART1_TX (VCP) = RXI\nPA10 = USART1_RX (VCP) = TXO\n\n\n"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 126.746 119.126 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "781af70b-2f99-42ab-ac6f-b2eb1560bbcd")
	)
	(text "Microcontroller evaluation board pin headers:\nGPIOs with names ending by _ might be used on the board. Check availability\n\nThe outline of the extension connectors of the microcontroller evaluation board\nwith a list of the available functions and peripherals on each pin is in\nMicrocontroller_STM32F429/Datasheets/Extension_Connectors.xlsx"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 127 51.054 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "afbba294-a808-45bd-ac9b-e7b5b30a0f39")
	)
	(text "List of available ADC inputs and DAC output:\nPF6 = ADC3_IN4      used for IN_LEFT\nPC3 = ADC123_IN13  used for IN_RIGHT\nPF8 = ADC3_IN6\nPC1 = ADC123_IN11\nPA5 = ADC12_IN5 or DAC_OUT2"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 126.746 70.612 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "b91f7077-add3-49d1-9cbc-dba863599e10")
	)
